    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist the main game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is the first act of Bullet Runner - a chaotic linear single-player shooter, packed with fast-paced and skill-based action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/660e58897b424ce33ce6cb14303e93d4.webp?t=1695042347\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/9a1903141ea028ba58edff1196dd0cac.poster.avif?t=1695042347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/9a1903141ea028ba58edff1196dd0cac.webm?t=1695042347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/9a1903141ea028ba58edff1196dd0cac.mp4?t=1695042347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way through <strong>HORDES OF POWERFUL ENEMIES</strong>, execute combat strategies with quick reflexes to take on the biggest of the baddies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/a029ec3d4e942d49f1374cce64cea674.webp?t=1695042347\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/1823e720baf60248185fdd1d46501183.poster.avif?t=1695042347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/1823e720baf60248185fdd1d46501183.webm?t=1695042347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343570/extras/1823e720baf60248185fdd1d46501183.mp4?t=1695042347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>